# Pairs with OrphanEventuallyRetired. A protocol defect with every fairness
# assumption intact: the classifier never reports a husk (a row with no tree id
# reads as checkpointed), so an orphan is never retired and its pin holds the
# floor for ever - issue #3105's original shape.
MODULE: OrphanEventuallyRetiredReadNeverHusk
TARGET: OrphanEventuallyRetired
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the leaf read never classifies a husk, so no orphan is retired
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
    /\ verdict' = [verdict EXCEPT ![p] = IF phase = "husk" THEN "husk" ELSE "live"]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a husk reads as live.
    /\ verdict' = [verdict EXCEPT ![p] = "live"]
--- END
